invariant: INV-64
file: srv_ticket.h
catches: cnsa2_server_test
reason: the profile's AES-256-GCM tickets take the version byte 2, the one
  every other server's ChaCha20-Poly1305 tickets carry, so one ticket_key
  shared across the two builds would read either cipher's ticket under the
  other's layout until the AEAD refused it. test_ticket requires the
  profile's first byte to be 3 and a version-2 ticket to be refused.

--- old
#define SRV_TICKET_VERSION 3
--- new
#define SRV_TICKET_VERSION 2
